  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "ESP32-C3-MINI-1 is an Espressif ESP32-C3 surface-mount radio module with an onboard PCB antenna. The official KiCad library supplies a STEP assembly for this module.\n\nThis reference describes the ESP32-C3-MINI-1 module, not a complete development board. External-antenna variants with different part numbers are excluded. Memory capacity and hardware revision are not inferred from the shared mechanical model. The STEP library is CC BY-SA 4.0 with the published KiCad electronic-design exception; retain the pinned license and attribution when redistributing."
    }
  ],
